---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
                <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="font-manrope text-4xl font-normal leading-tight text-left text-white lg:text-5xl" data-translate="fit.title">Is Garna Employer of Record <br class="hidden md:block lg:hidden">the Right Fit for Your Business?</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid gap-3">
                        <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-4"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:check" width="20" class="mt-0.5 text-[#5EA500]"></iconify-icon><p data-translate="fit.items.1">You want to bring on international staff without setting up an office in every country</p></div>
                        <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-4"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:check" width="20" class="mt-0.5 text-[#5EA500]"></iconify-icon><p data-translate="fit.items.2">You want to automate global payroll, taxes, and compliance instead of juggling manual workflows</p></div>
                        <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-4"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:check" width="20" class="mt-0.5 text-[#5EA500]"></iconify-icon><p data-translate="fit.items.3">You already have international talent to hire and need help with contracts, onboarding, and compliance</p></div>
                        <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-4"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:check" width="20" class="mt-0.5 text-[#5EA500]"></iconify-icon><p data-translate="fit.items.4">You want to scale distributed teams fast without building internal HR and payroll infrastructure</p></div>
                        <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-4"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:check" width="20" class="mt-0.5 text-[#5EA500]"></iconify-icon><p data-translate="fit.items.6">You need contractor management, bank transfers, cryptocurrency payouts, and multi-country payroll in one platform</p></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </Section>
